{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Awkward physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the slippery, bouncy movement of a potion bottle. Every jump demands perfect timing, angling, and speed control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Death...everywhere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no safe zones. Title screen? Game lobby? Even checkpoints? All of them are potential death traps. One bad landing, and you shatter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick your poison</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use optional checkpoints to save progress \u2014 but at a cost. Choose wisely. Not every risk is worth it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Short but brutal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fewer levels, higher skill ceiling. It\u2019s a concentrated, punishing experience that\u2019s incredibly rewarding to overcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lore-accurate difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the game on normal? Try \u201clore-accurate\u201d mode. It\u2019s the way it was meant to be played\u2026 and you probably won\u2019t survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809760?t=1751676680","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809760?t=1751676680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809760/1cb98e1d3e02a9ab4cedeb76d7ee66c7811664de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751676680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809760/1cb98e1d3e02a9ab4cedeb76d7ee66c7811664de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751676680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3848070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Awkward physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the slippery, bouncy movement of a potion bottle. Every jump demands perfect timing, angling, 